# The Supabase CLI always writes link/deploy state under <cwd>/supabase/,
# regardless of the actual folder name — deploying from supabase-pt/ or
# supabase-dp/ creates a *nested* supabase/.temp/ inside them. Never
# real function code, always safe to delete/ignore.
supabase-pt/supabase/
supabase-dp/supabase/
supabase-identity/supabase/
